@startuml ContextDFD

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam linetype ortho

<style>
rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #f0f4ff
  BorderColor #555555
  FontSize 11
}
actor {
  FontSize 11
}
arrow {
  LineColor #333333
  FontSize 10
}
database {
  BackgroundColor #fff8e1
  BorderColor #555555
  FontSize 11
}
</style>

actor      "Player"                    as Player
rectangle  "Katagma\n(Game System)"   as System  #e8f5e9
database   "Firebase\n(Firestore)"    as Firebase
database   "Local Storage\n(PlayerPrefs)" as Local

Player  -->  System   : keyboard & mouse input
System  -->  Player   : rendered game state

System  -->  Firebase : score submission
Firebase --> System   : leaderboard data

System  -->  Local    : story progress, last player name
Local   -->  System   : story progress,\n last player name

@enduml
